        Traditional Accessories & Where to Find Them
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-warm-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        The details make the look. A hand-carved jade hairpin, an embroidered silk fan, a pair of cloud-sole shoes — these are the pieces that complete a traditional Chinese outfit, and they're also the most portable souvenirs of your trip.
      </p>

